tps://i.imgur.com/xVTnXJR.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"400\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/e3r5NBO.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"400\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JClLnkj.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"400\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AUJJApl.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"400\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zAb5DjU.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"400\"></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">相容性表格</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zAQ1Bvr.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"1790\"></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">要查看更多範例，請前往&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fhyper-realistic-sky%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Planet Minecraft 頁面</a>。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">差不多就是這樣了，希望你能享受這個資源包！</span></p>",
